{
  "title": "RemoteFM1",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "FM-1 firmwares run",
        "on the Move itself:",
        "three at once, each",
        "in its own slot.",
        "",
        "Play them from the",
        "pads, knobs and the",
        "sequencer.",
        "",
        "A phone or computer",
        "on the same Wi-Fi:",
        "remotefm1.local:7730",
        "shows the FM-1's",
        "screen, Mix & FX,",
        "files and more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Leaving",
      "lines": [
        "Shift + touch the",
        "volume knob + click",
        "the jog wheel.",
        "",
        "Move's own software",
        "starts again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Accessibility",
      "lines": [
        "RemoteFM1 speaks",
        "what the Move shows:",
        "modes, views, slots,",
        "firmwares, knobs",
        "and loads.",
        "",
        "Global Settings",
        "(Track 4 held +",
        "step 2) >",
        "Speech: Off, On, or",
        "Jog (only while you",
        "touch the jog).",
        "",
        "Voice, speed and",
        "volume are",
        "Schwung's settings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Track Buttons",
      "lines": [
        "Track 1-3: the three",
        "firmware slots.",
        "Track 4: Mixer,",
        "Routing, Sequencer.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 1-3: play",
        "that firmware in",
        "its own layout.",
        "Hold: its layout",
        "menu. Double tap:",
        "the firmware list.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 4: Mixer /",
        "Routing. Hold: pad 1",
        "Mixer, pad 2",
        "Routing, steps the",
        "Shift shortcuts.",
        "Double: projects.",
        "",
        "Back: the Sequencer",
        "and back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Layout Menu",
      "lines": [
        "Hold Track 1-3:",
        "top pads: FM-1,",
        "the firmware's own,",
        "Scale, Chroma,",
        "Drum, Octave;",
        "pad 8: latch.",
        "Other pads: scales.",
        "Steps: channel.",
        "Jog: root.",
        "Up/Down: octave.",
        "Knobs: CC numbers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FM-1 Mode",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "Playing",
          "lines": [
            "Pads are the FM-1's",
            "keys. Knob 1 SELECT,",
            "2 PRESET, 3 ALGO,",
            "5-8 the FM-1's",
            "knobs; its buttons.",
            "Volume is MASTER.",
            "",
            "Jog: SELECT; click",
            "for PRESET, ALGO.",
            "Up: the FM-1's SEQ",
            "Down: the next",
            " loaded firmware"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Labels",
          "lines": [
            "Touch a knob: its",
            "name and value.",
            "",
            "Hold a button: what",
            "it does now.",
            "",
            "Touch the jog wheel",
            "and press buttons:",
            "each shows its",
            "label at once.",
            "",
            "Popup size: Global",
            "Settings, knob 4."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Firmwares",
      "children": [
        {
          "title": "The Firmware View",
          "lines": [
            "Double tap Track",
            "1-3: its firmwares.",
            "Back: out again.",
            "",
            "Pads pick a firmware",
            "Jog press: load it",
            "Jog turn: its info",
            "Left/Right: banks",
            "Delete: unload"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Lists & Filters",
          "lines": [
            "Step 1: Favorites",
            "Step 2: All",
            "Steps 3-7: category",
            "Steps 8-15: tags",
            "Step 16: Fantasy",
            "",
            "Sample: favorite",
            "Knob 1: pad colour"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Download & Update",
          "lines": [
            "Mute: the catalog.",
            "Step 1: updates",
            "Step 2: not",
            " installed",
            "",
            "Jog press downloads",
            "(Wi-Fi), then loads",
            "it into the track."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Switching Slots",
          "lines": [
            "Tap Track 1-3: play",
            "that slot.",
            "",
            "Down (FM-1 layout):",
            "the next loaded",
            "slot.",
            "",
            "Track 1-3 held +",
            "volume: that slot's",
            "level."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "States",
          "lines": [
            "Loop: the firmware's",
            "saved states.",
            "Pad: load a state",
            "Empty pad: save",
            "Copy + pad: save",
            " over it",
            "Delete + pad: delete",
            "Loop or Back: leave"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FX & Mix",
      "lines": [
        "Your Schwung MIDI FX",
        "and audio FX run",
        "inside RemoteFM1.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 4: the",
        "Mixer; again:",
        "Routing (FX pages).",
        "",
        "Hold an FX pad and",
        "turn the jog: pick",
        "a module. Jog click:",
        "its pages. Back:",
        "out of the pages."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Note Layouts",
      "lines": [
        "Scale, Chroma, Drum",
        "and Octave: pads",
        "play notes on the",
        "slot's channel.",
        "",
        "Knobs send CCs.",
        "Shift + knob: its",
        "CC number.",
        "Shift + step: the",
        "Shift shortcuts.",
        "Play: the sequencer.",
        "Up/Down: octave."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sequencer",
      "lines": [
        "16 tracks, each on",
        "its own MIDI",
        "channel, like Move's",
        "own sequencer.",
        "Back flips to it.",
        "",
        "Tap Track 1-3: the",
        "track locked to",
        "that firmware.",
        "Hold Track 1-3:",
        "steps are tracks.",
        "Tap: lock",
        "Double tap: solo",
        "Hold: not routed",
        "",
        "It keeps playing.",
        "Sync: INT by",
        "default."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "An FM-1 as Panel",
      "lines": [
        "Plug an FM-1 running",
        "RemoteFM1 into the",
        "Move's USB-A: its",
        "keys, knobs and LEDs",
        "work. Its screen",
        "shows a plug icon.",
        "",
        "With the Wi-Fi build",
        "on the same Wi-Fi",
        "the Move finds it,",
        "screen and all.",
        "",
        "Set up its Wi-Fi on",
        "the page, or on the",
        "FM-1: hold HOME,",
        "the WI-FI row."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "More",
      "lines": [
        "Guide:",
        "remotefm1.com/move",
        "",
        "Source and issues:",
        "github.com/",
        "Quixotic7/",
        "remoteFM14Move"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
